### Interaction Patterns

**Text-selection → search pre-population:**
- `mouseup` on `<mark>` element: copies term to `Input` value; triggers search API call (debounced 300ms); scrolls panel to search results

**Dictionary suggestion add:**
- Click "+ Add": adds to staged codes list; `Banner variant="info"` "Added to staged codes." (auto-dismiss 2s)
- Same SNOMED code cannot be staged twice (deduplicated; button becomes "Added ✓" and disables)

**Commit codes:**
- Enabled only when `stagedCodes.length > 0`
- On click: loading state (`Button` shows spinner); each code written independently
- Partial success possible (per-code result): show per-code outcome in `Notification` summary

